              "type": "text",
              "text": "Trip profile:\n<data name=\"profile\">\n{\"departure\":{\"city\":\"Chicago\",\"mode\":\"plane\"},\"dateRange\":{\"kind\":\"flexible\",\"month\":3,\"year\":2027},\"region\":\"Caribbean\",\"experiences\":[\"beach\"],\"people\":[{\"userType\":\"adult\"},{\"userType\":\"adult\"}]}\n</data>\n\nRecommendations:\n<data name=\"recommendations\">\n[{\"destination\":\"Punta Cana, Dominican Republic\",\"summary\":\"March is dry season in the Caribbean, with warm sunny days and calm seas. Punta Cana has long white-sand beaches and many resorts, a good fit for two adults wanting a beach-focused getaway from Chicago.\",\"matchedExperiences\":[\"beach\"]},{\"destination\":\"Nassau, Bahamas\",\"summary\":\"Nassau and nearby Paradise Island offer soft sand beaches and clear turquoise water, and it is a short trip from Chicago. March is pleasant, though the water can be cooler than in the southern Caribbean.\",\"matchedExperiences\":[\"beach\"]},{\"destination\":\"San Juan, Puerto Rico\",\"summary\":\"San Juan combines city-side beaches such as Condado and Isla Verde with a historic old town. March brings warm, dry weather, and the trip is easy from Chicago, with no passport needed for U.S. citizens.\",\"matchedExperiences\":[\"beach\"]}]\n</data>"
            }
